      ":question/problem": "Jane works at a bank and earns $$50$ every $2$ hours. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. Jane earns $$200$ for $8$ hours work.\n2. The relationship between the number of hours Jane works and her wage is linear.\n3. The relationship between the number of hours Jane works and her wage is exponential.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
